    "description": "Prepare for tears, laughter and drama as our Chelsea regulars hit the LA scene with a bang. With new friends, hangouts and hobbies, it is set to be a summer never to be forgotten. Flying in to shake up LA “Chelsea style” will be Londoners, Lucy Watson, Mark-Francis Vandelli, Binky Felstead, Louise Thompson, Jamie Laing, Alex Mytton, JP, Jess Woodley, James Dunmore, Josh Shepherd and Toff and American favourites Stephanie Pratt and Alik Alfus. With a heaving social scene, the Made in Chelsea girls and guys have met some new faces along the way. Cue Naz Gharai, Bryan Mione, Cody Weselis, Noah Bewley and Olivia Fox.",
